          "heading": "Fiji chairman says Jake White won't coach flair out of side",
          "body": "Fiji's chairman says Jake White will not coach the flair out of the side as the team chase a place at the 2027 World Cup. The message matters because results have been hard to find: the log shows Fiji still without a win from three matches, and their latest outing was a 15-20 loss to Japan in the Pacific Nations Cup. Next up is France in Round 4."
