          "kicker": "Newest cap",
          "heading": "Emmanuel Iyogun credits Ox Nche chat for path to England cap",
          "body": "Northampton loosehead Emmanuel Iyogun says an out-of-the-blue message to Springbok prop Ox Nche two summers ago set him on the road to England. Nche replied politely, and the pair spent about three hours over diet Cokes talking scrums. \"He had no reason to have time for me,\" Iyogun says. The 25-year-old made his Test debut away to Argentina in July, and credits Nche's advice on set-piece play and life for speeding his progress."
        },
