        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Ramos, Jalibert and Meafou ruled out of France's Springboks test",
          "body": "Thomas Ramos, Matthieu Jalibert and Emmanuel Meafou are all out for the whole Nations Championship, leaving Fabien Galthié to rebuild France's side for the Springboks test in Paris. Planet Rugby's view is that the losses are about quality rather than depth: Jalibert is described as the best attacking ten in the Northern Hemisphere over four seasons, and Meafou as scrum ballast nobody else in France can provide. Julien Marchand and Régis Montagne are doubtful, and Thibaud Flament, Demba Bamba and Lenni Nouchi are also out."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Caelan Doris ruled out of Ireland's November window through injury",
