          "kicker": "Captaincy call",
          "heading": "Dan Sheehan named Ireland captain again as Caelan Doris misses November",
          "body": "Dan Sheehan will once again captain Ireland through the four-game November window, with Caelan Doris ruled out by injury. Hooker Sheehan takes the armband in Doris's absence from a squad already shorn of several key men: Jack Crowley, Harry Byrne and Bryn Ward are also out. Jack Conan, who hurt a shoulder in Leinster's 48-23 win at Clermont Auvergne last weekend, will miss the window too."
        },
