          "kicker": "Squad absences",
          "heading": "Italy reported to be missing 12 players for next month's Nations Championship",
          "body": "Italy are reported to be missing 12 players for next month's Nations Championship, a number that would test Gonzalo Quesada's depth before a busy November. Fixtures take them to Turin to face South Africa, then Genoa against Argentina and Udine against Fiji, before the finals at Twickenham. Toulouse centre Tommaso Menoncello is one name already set to miss, with a shoulder sprain expected to keep him out for several weeks."
        },
