          "body": "Scotland will face the All Blacks in New Zealand for the first time in 27 years, a separate trip from their Round 4 meeting with the same side. Their last outing was a 33-17 win over Fiji in Round 3, and they have won two of three so far, sitting fifth of 12 in the log."
