          "kicker": "Selection debate",
          "heading": "Lyn Jones tips Scarlets wing Macs Page for 'huge future' with Wales",
          "body": "Former Dragons and Ospreys boss Lyn Jones says Scarlets wing Macs Page has a \"huge future\" with Wales, despite his omission from Steve Tandy's Nations Championship squad. Jones, speaking to BBC Radio Wales, feels Page's age may have counted against him, and calls him \"one of the best players I have seen playing this season\". Page, 21, toured Japan with Wales in 2025 without winning a cap, and RUCK reports four tries in four Scarlets appearances so far."
