          "heading": "Argentina's best-ever world ranking is No. 3, reached in 2007–08",
          "body": "Argentina's best-ever world ranking is No. 3, reached in 2007–08. Set against that high-water mark, the current log has them eighth of 12, with one win and two defeats from three matches and a 28-28 draw with Australia as their most recent result. Across those three matches they have scored 97 and conceded 99. Their next fixture is Round 4 against Ireland."
