          "heading": "Isuzu named official automotive partner for Australia's 2027 men's World Cup",
          "body": "World Rugby has confirmed Isuzu Motors as Official Automotive Partner for the men's World Cup in Australia in 2027 and the Women's World Cup in 2029. For Wallabies fans, the sponsor adds a visible layer to a home tournament, with Isuzu committing to fan-led activations at venues and Fan Festivals across the host cities. Isuzu, which has more than 160 authorised outlets across Australia, is also exploring transport solutions for participating teams and the tournament workforce."
