          "heading": "Japan men's sevens beat Hong Kong China 28-14 in Asia series final",
          "body": "Japan's men's sevens side got some revenge on Hong Kong China, winning 28-14 in the final of Leg 2 of the Asia Rugby Emirates Sevens Series in Colombo. The result inflicted a rare defeat on the defending champions, though Hong Kong China kept the series title on points differential. Japan Men's Sevens head coach Phil Greening said the win showed the team's ability to adapt to different situations."
