          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Kieran Read expects Damian McKenzie back at full-back when Richie Mo'unga recovers",
          "body": "Former All Blacks captain Kieran Read expects Damian McKenzie to move back to full-back once Richie Mo'unga recovers from a calf injury. McKenzie has started the last two Bledisloe Cup Tests at fly-half after Mo'unga and Ruben Love were ruled out. Ex-All Blacks scrum-half Justin Marshall says McKenzie has massively elevated himself, but expects the November Tests against Scotland, Wales and England to be a sterner test."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
